{#
  Per-hostname :8443 sites for co-located development.

  The dev overlay Caddyfile (<dev root>/dev/orchestration/Caddyfile) is a
  static file and stays the loaded config. It defines the (turbopanel_app)
  snippet, serves :8443 with the Platform CA leaf, and ends with
  `import {$TURBOPANEL_DEV_SITES_DIR}/*.caddy`. This file is what that glob
  picks up: the same named sites a managed install renders into its own
  Caddyfile, so an uploaded or DNS-01 certificate for the dev panel's
  hostname is served by name (SNI) while :8443 keeps the Platform CA leaf.
#}
